[[Deft Lahar]] is the Homestead Master of the [[Lowland Kodan]] [[Lowland Kodan Council|Council]] who provides instructions on how to maintain the [[homestead]]. During [[festival]]s, he can be found in a [[city]] related to that festival, selling [[Handiworker#Recipe sheets|recipe sheet]]s for homestead [[decoration]]s.

