== Dialogue ==
;In [[Hearth's Glow]] after completing [[Home Sweet Home]]
{{main|Homestead Master}}

;At [[Deft Lahar's Abode]]
:Hrum? What do you need?
:<small>'''(During [[Home Sweet Home]], during the step "Use Your Warclaw to Topple Trees and Collect Lumber")'''</small>
:{{dialogue icon|story}} ''If I help supply materials for you, would you tell me more about crafting?''
::You scratch my back, I scratch yours—that it? Well, fine. We need logs, but the trees won't fell themselves.
::{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Deal. I'll be back soon.''
:<small>'''(During [[Home Sweet Home]], during the step "Return to your homestead with materials for making a traditional kodan bed.")'''</small>
:{{dialogue icon|story}} ''What materials do I need to gather to craft this bed?''
::You'll need a good amount of wood for this kind of project. But if you use higher-quality logs, it won't take as many to refine what you need.
::{{dialogue icon|story}} ''How do I refine wood?''
:::You can refine wood and other materials at your homestead. Refined materials are the key to quality decorations you can take pride in.
:::{{dialogue icon|story}} ''What else do I need?''
::::Some wool for the padding and blankets. And honey flowers are a key component of the traditional dying process Willow taught you.
::::{{dialogue icon|story}} ''Where can I find honey flowers?''
:::::They grow wild throughout the delta. Keep an eye out; I'm sure you'll have enough gathered in no time.
:::::{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Thank you!''
::::{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Thank you!''
:::{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Thank you!''
::{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Noted. Thank you.''
:<small>'''(If [[Jug of Wildflower Cyser]] is in inventory and haven't completed [[Home Sweet Home#Achievements|Returning Kindness]])'''</small>
:{{dialogue icon|give}} ''I wanted to bring you and Willow a gift for helping make my house a home.''
::Well, now. Seems I was too hard on you when you first came to me for help.
::{{dialogue icon|more}} ''I thought you might like it.''
:::'''Patient Willow:''' Well, aren't you as sweet as the drink itself. Thank you! We'll put that to good use tonight, won't we, Har?
:::{{dialogue icon|end}} ''(chuckles) You're welcome.''
:{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Never mind.''

;During [[Lunar New Year]] in [[Divinity's Reach]]
:Hrum, what a style—the [[Kodan Cub|cubs]] in [[Janthir]] wouldn't know what to gawk at first. I've adapted a number of [[decoration]]s for your [[homestead]]—I just need a pinch of [[Luck]] in trade.
:{{dialogue icon|sell}} ''Show me your wares.''
:{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Too bad there's no year of the [[bear]], eh?''

;During [[Super Adventure Festival]] in [[Rata Sum]]
:Most cubs think these things are super, though they're a touch sharp for my taste. I've adapted a number of decorations for your homestead—I just need a few [[bauble]]s. For the cubs.
:{{dialogue icon|sell}} ''Show me your wares.''
:{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Another time might be super.''

;During [[Dragon Bash]] in [[Hoelbrak]]
:This fiery decor may just fly off the shelves. I've adapted a number of [[decoration]]s for your [[homestead]]—I just need [[zhaitaffy]] in trade. Hrm... For the missus's stockpile.
:{{dialogue icon|sell}} ''Show me your wares.''
:{{dialogue icon|end}} ''I fear [[Elder Dragons|dragons]] may not fit well within my homestead.''

;During [[Festival of the Four Winds]] in [[Labyrinthine Cliffs]]
:I see the [[Zephyrites]] are no strangers to the appeal of a well-kept home. I've adapted a number of [[decoration]]s for your [[homestead]]—for a small trade, you can bring some souvenirs back home.
:{{dialogue icon|sell}} ''Show me your wares.''
:{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Hold on, I need to budget carefully before a shopping spree.''

;During [[Halloween]] in [[Lion's Arch]]
:Hrm... The aesthetic here's a little dark for my taste, but I can see the appeal. I've adapted a number of decorations for your Homestead—I just need a bit of [[Piece of Candy Corn|candy]] in trade. For the folks back home.
:{{dialogue icon|sell}} ''Show me your wares.''
:{{dialogue icon|end}} ''I don't know... It's a bit spooky for me.''

;During [[Wintersday]] in [[Divinity's Reach]]
:Not bad. I can see the celebratory changes across the whole [[city]]. I've adapted a number of decorations for your homestead—I just need a few [[snowflake]]s in trade. For the missus's crafts.
:{{dialogue icon|sell}} ''Show me your wares.''
:{{dialogue icon|end}} ''I don't know if I could handle Wintersday year-round.''

